1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
What kinds of businesses do you think are going to succeed

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,480
because AI is so prevalent and people get tired of it?

3
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,720
I think the businesses that will have disproportionate returns

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,720
are ones that are very ops heavy.

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,600
So a marketing agency, for example,

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,960
that heavily introduces AI,

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,360
there will never be a lack of businesses

8
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,760
that want new customers.

9
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,160
The difficulty with scaling that particular type of business

10
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,800
is the operational drag and the headcount

11
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,920
and the coordination of people.

12
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:24,960
And so if you can have something

13
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,360
that has amazing product market fit,

14
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,160
which is get more customers for somebody,

15
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,120
there's lots of demand there.

16
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,240
But do it in a way that allows you to scale the ops

17
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,080
so that you have increasing margins

18
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,240
and you have less complexity,

19
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,600
that becomes incredibly valuable business.

20
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,880
So people heavy, ops heavy businesses

21
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,240
that are largely digital,

22
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,640
those are businesses that will benefit the most.

